      "round_summary": "Round 2/3 — fix next-computation dependency on io.start. error_type=dut_bug. root_cause: cubeAbs.scala line 39 used `Cat(io.start(4,1), ~posReg(0))`, making next depend on the free formal input io.start rather than the current registered position. The upper bits of io.start varied arbitrarily, frequently producing next ≥ 27, causing dest to clamp to posReg (stuck at 0), preventing any progress through the cube and triggering the progress_bounded liveness timer. Fix: changed to `Cat(posReg(4,1), ~posReg(0))` so next is derived purely from the current position (flipping LSB to move along primary axis), independent of io.start. Target assertion label `progress_bounded` preserved unchanged. No homologous assertions — assertLivenessTimer appears only once in the source.",
